क्रियते तदिह प्रोक्तं राजसं चलमध्रुवम् ॥ १८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4368,\"bb\":3836,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/18/b3836/\",\"body_value\":\"satkāra-māna-pūjārthaṁ
tapo dambhena caiva yat
kriyate tad iha proktaṁ
rājasaṁ calam adhruvam\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4369,\"bb\":3837,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/18/b3837/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sat-kāra – respect; māna – honor; pūjā – and worship; artham – for the sake of; tapaḥ – austerity; dambhena – with pride; ca – also; eva – certainly; yat – which; kriyate – is performed; tat – that; iha – in this world; proktam – is said; rājasam – in the mode of passion; calam – flickering; adhruvam – temporary.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sat-kāra\",\"translation\":\"respect\"},{\"word\":\"māna\",\"translation\":\"honor\"},{\"word\":\"pūjā\",\"translation\":\"and worship\"},{\"word\":\"artham\",\"translation\":\"for the sake of\"},{\"word\":\"tapaḥ\",\"translation\":\"austerity\"},{\"word\":\"dambhena\",\"translation\":\"with pride\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"yat\",\"translation\":\"which\"},{\"word\":\"kriyate\",\"translation\":\"is performed\"},{\"word\":\"tat\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"iha\",\"translation\":\"in this world\"},{\"word\":\"proktam\",\"translation\":\"is said\"},{\"word\":\"rājasam\",\"translation\":\"in the mode of passion\"},{\"word\":\"calam\",\"translation\":\"flickering\"},{\"word\":\"adhruvam\",\"translation\":\"temporary\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4370,\"bb\":3838,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/18/b3838/\",\"body_value\":\"Penance performed out of pride and for the sake of gaining respect, honor and worship is said to be in the mode of passion. It is neither stable nor permanent.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4371,\"bb\":3839,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/18/b3839/\",\"body_value\":\"Sometimes penance and austerity are executed to attract people and receive honor, respect and worship from others. Persons in the mode of passion arrange to be worshiped by subordinates and let them wash their feet and offer riches. Such arrangements artificially made by the performance of penances are considered to be in the mode of passion. The results are temporary; they can be continued for some time, but they are not permanent.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 17.18\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 17.18\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/bg/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"childre