देशे काले च पात्रे च तद्दानं सात्त्विकं स्मृतम् ॥ २० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4380,\"bb\":3846,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/20/b3846/\",\"body_value\":\"dātavyam iti yad dānaṁ
dīyate ’nupakāriṇe
deśe kāle ca pātre ca
tad dānaṁ sāttvikaṁ smṛtam\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4381,\"bb\":3847,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/20/b3847/\",\"shadow_value\":\"dātavyam – worth giving; iti – thus; yat – that which; dānam – charity; dīyate – is given; anupakāriṇe – irrespective of return; deśe – in a proper place; kāle – at a proper time; ca – also; pātre – to a suitable person; ca – and; tat – that; dānam – charity; sāttvikam – in the mode of goodness; smṛtam – is considered.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"dātavyam\",\"translation\":\"worth giving\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"yat\",\"translation\":\"that which\"},{\"word\":\"dānam\",\"translation\":\"charity\"},{\"word\":\"dīyate\",\"translation\":\"is given\"},{\"word\":\"anupakāriṇe\",\"translation\":\"irrespective of return\"},{\"word\":\"deśe\",\"translation\":\"in a proper place\"},{\"word\":\"kāle\",\"translation\":\"at a proper time\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"pātre\",\"translation\":\"to a suitable person\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"tat\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"dānam\",\"translation\":\"charity\"},{\"word\":\"sāttvikam\",\"translation\":\"in the mode of goodness\"},{\"word\":\"smṛtam\",\"translation\":\"is considered\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4382,\"bb\":3848,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/20/b3848/\",\"body_value\":\"Charity given out of duty, without expectation of return, at the proper time and place, and to a worthy person is considered to be in the mode of goodness.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4383,\"bb\":3849,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/20/b3849/\",\"body_value\":\"In the Vedic literature, charity given to a person engaged in spiritual activities is recommended. There is no recommendation for giving charity indiscriminately. Spiritual perfection is always a consideration. Therefore charity is recommended to be given at a place of pilgrimage and at lunar or solar eclipses or at the end of the month or to a qualified brāhmaṇa or a Vaiṣṇava (devotee) or in temples. Such charities should be given without any consideration of return. Charity to the poor is sometimes given out of compassion, but if a poor man is not worth giving charity to, then there is no spiritual advancement. In other words, indiscriminate charity is not recommended in the Vedic literature.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 17.20\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 17.20\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"l